flowchart TD
    P1[POWER ON\nLED 2 flashes]
    P2[HARDWARE INIT\nGPIO, SPI, I2C, ADC]
    P3[EEPROM INIT\nConfig, counters, DevNonce, CRC check]
    P4[SDHC INIT\nMount card or continue without]
    P5[RTC INIT\nRead time, flag if invalid]
    P6[EPD INIT\nDisplay Connecting if Variant A]
    P7[LORA INIT\nSX1262, credentials]
    P8[LORA JOIN\nOTAA 10 attempts; offline + 1hr rejoin if fail]
    P9[RTC SYNC\nDeviceTimeReq if connected]
    P10[EPD UPDATE\nLast Cleaned + timestamp if Variant A]
    P11[BOOT UPLINK\nEvent 0x04, flush queue if connected]
    P12[NORMAL MODE\nEnable buttons, heartbeat, rejoin timer if offline]

    P1 --> P2 --> P3 --> P4 --> P5 --> P6 --> P7 --> P8 --> P9 --> P10 --> P11 --> P12
